            "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:47:24.507654+00:00",
            "notes": "Depending on enemy team comp, this might be the round where you get to finally strut your stuff.\n\nIf they're building lots of debuff items (for instance, healing reduction or lava/fire damage on abilities), you probably still want to rock Cleaning Charge. You can get Kitsune ultra-fast if the enemy lets you.\n\nIf not, then it's time to become the main character by acquiring Spirit Veil.\n\nThis ability provides 4 seconds of invulnerability when you use your ultimate. For reference, Zenyatta's ultimate lasts for 6 seconds... and he can't shoot during it!\n\nWhen you have your ult, you can go all the way in, right on top of them, and pop it! Use your four seconds wisely - you can probably secure at least one guaranteed kill, but likely more if your aim is true. Lots of players don't even realize you're invincible at this moment, and will waste time, ammo, and attention shooting at the squishy that's right in front of them, giving your teammates opportunity to push in.\n\nAll of this, on top of the firerate buff and cooldown reduction your ult grants, and you can easily be putting out 250 damage per second without hitting a single headshot, with a teleport and a suzu to escape when those four seconds finally run out. If you catch an Orisa with her abilities on cooldown, you can burst her down in just those few seconds... and there's nothing she can do about it!",
