            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:47:24.507654+00:00",
            "notes": "It's time for things to get really scary for the enemy team.\n\nYour kitsune rush now slows them down massively, making it harder for them to escape your stage... and making it ever easier for you to land your headshots.\n\nAt this point, your DPS is just outrageous. At +~90% of your usual total damage output, you can hurt them bad for as much as 230 damage per second, twice that if you hit all headshots. On top of your firerate buff from your ult, that's a damage per second of about 330, 660 for all headshots. Enough to take out any tank in those glorious 4 seconds where the only option the enemy has to deal with you is to run away.\n\nAnd because your Healing Ofuda are affected too, your healing is still terrific! There's no reason not to be always throwing your heals out when you have the opportunity. In fact, sometimes it can be effective to throw your ult down just for the heals; at peak, your ofuda should be healing for around 360 health per second if you're standing in your ult. Slightly more on teammates below half health! That's a huge amount of sustain - your tanks will thank you.",
